    "Use separate I2C1/I2C2; both sensors have default7bit address0x35.",
    "Disable JTAG use on PA15 while keeping SWD PA13/PA14.",
    "Set INT direction/mode before driving; MCU inputs by default. INT can support conversion synchronization later.",
    "Configure nSWBOOT0/nBOOT0 deliberately;10k physical BOOT0 pulldown remains present.",
    "Sample both rings at a common time or compensate acquisition skew; TMAG angle register is track phase, not full mechanical angle.",
    "Calibrate each assembled joint with both rings; check absolute sector uniqueness under eccentricity and cross-track fields.",
    "CAN node IDs1..12 stored in flash; identical PCB hardware, termination DNP by default."
  ],
